{'symbol': 'AVB', 'date': '2021-11-10 16:15:00', 'title': "AVALONBAY COMMUNITIES, INC. AWARDED NAREIT'S 2021 RESIDENTIAL LEADER IN THE LIGHT AWARD", 'text': "ARLINGTON, VA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AVALONBAY COMMUNITIES, INC. (NYSE: AVB) — THE NATIONAL ASSOCIATION OF REAL ESTATE INVESTMENT TRUSTS (NAREIT) HAS AGAIN NAMED AVALONBAY COMMUNITIES, INC. THE 2021 LEADER IN THE LIGHT AWARD RECIPIENT FOR THE RESIDENTIAL SECTOR. THE COMPANY ALSO RECEIVED THE AWARD IN 2020, 2019, 2015, 2013 AND 2012. NAREIT'S ANNUAL LEADER IN THE LIGHT AWARDS HONOR NAREIT MEMBER COMPANIES THAT HAVE DEMONSTRATED SUPERIOR AND SUSTAINED ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) PRACTI"}